WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.039 --> 00:00:05.183
Bonk! Bang! Clank!

2
00:00:05.184 --> 00:00:09.095
The spaceship made lots of sounds.

3
00:00:09.096 --> 00:00:13.542
"Ugh!" Lucy said.

4
00:00:13.543 --> 00:00:16.685
"This thing will fall apart!"

5
00:00:16.686 --> 00:00:24.602
"We're almost at Space Patrol," Bot said.

6
00:00:24.603 --> 00:00:30.437
The spaceship flew into the base.

7
00:00:30.438 --> 00:00:33.521
"Oh no!" Ringo said.

8
00:00:33.522 --> 00:00:36.344
"I see Commander Cosmo.

9
00:00:36.345 --> 00:00:39.920
He's already inspecting everyone!"

10
00:00:39.921 --> 00:00:44.224
Bot quickly landed.

11
00:00:44.225 --> 00:00:48.321
Smoke poured out of the spaceship.

12
00:00:48.322 --> 00:00:52.463
Ringo, Lucy, and Bot got out.

13
00:00:52.464 --> 00:00:56.065
Captain Nova stomped toward them.

14
00:00:56.066 --> 00:01:02.911
Ringo bit his lip. "We're in big trouble!"

15
00:01:02.912 --> 00:01:06.981
Captain Nova frowned. "You're late!

16
00:01:06.982 --> 00:01:09.000
And that spaceship is—"

17
00:01:09.001 --> 00:01:13.404
"A classic!" Commander Cosmo ran over.

18
00:01:13.405 --> 00:01:17.984
"Huh?" everyone said.

19
00:01:17.985 --> 00:01:22.939
"It's an old Zoom Star," Commander Cosmo said.

20
00:01:22.940 --> 00:01:26.322
"My first spaceship was a Zoom Star.

21
00:01:26.323 --> 00:01:29.738
This looks just like it!"

22
00:01:29.739 --> 00:01:34.024
"We rented this one," Ringo said.

23
00:01:34.025 --> 00:01:38.093
"It's from a repair shop on Rusty Moon."

24
00:01:38.094 --> 00:01:48.341
"I love it!" Commander Cosmo said.

25
00:01:48.342 --> 00:01:53.561
A week later Ringo's spaceship was fixed.

26
00:01:53.562 --> 00:02:01.338
Commander Cosmo bought the Zoom Star.

27
00:02:01.339 --> 00:02:05.776
"Thanks for finding this, Ringo," Commander Cosmo said.

28
00:02:05.777 --> 00:02:08.141
"I can't wait to fix it up!"

29
00:02:08.142 --> 00:02:14.356
He turned it on.

30
00:02:14.357 --> 00:02:29.897
Bonk! Bang! Clank!

